<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n87477" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προηγορ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be spokesman for</i> others, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				5.5.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.386b
			</span></i>: c. gen., <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				2.2.22
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τινί</span>
			<i>speak for,</i> i.e. <i>in defence of,</i> another, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Brut.</u>
				6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>to be senior in rank,</i> of the Roman consul who possesses the
				<i>fasces, Not.Arch.</i><i><span class="en">
				4.23
			</span></i> (Cyrene, Aug.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Dor.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προᾱγορέω</span></b> , <i>hold the
				office of</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προάγορος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				14.952
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Agrigentum</span>).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
